# Prettier's ignore file. Stylelint and ESLint do not use it: `yarn lint:styles` names its own folder,
# and ESLint's ignores live in "1. App/eslint.config.mjs" (globalIgnores).
# Patterns carry no folder prefix so they match from the repo root and from "1. App/".
#
# Prettier walks every folder below its target before this file filters the files out, so the
# `format:base` script in "1. App/package.json" runs it from the repo root (where its built-in
# node_modules and .git prunes apply; from "1. App" with ".." they never match) and passes the
# biggest ignored trees as `!` patterns, which keep the walk out of them (2026-10-31: 69,000
# walked entries for 171 candidates before, about 230 after). A tree missing there costs time
# only; a tree missing here gets formatted.

# Dependencies and lockfiles
node_modules
.yarn
yarn.lock
package-lock.json

